   "note": "passbook vs shopping basket shrinking"
  },
  {
   "id": "D5",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 50,
   "len": 98,
   "first": 5266,
   "line": "A week later, a man in a suit comes to see you.",
   "note": "MỘT TUẦN SAU: suit walks into kitchen"
  },
  {
   "id": "D6",
   "size": "insert",
   "key": 30,
   "len": 55,
   "first": 5364,
   "line": "He works at the central bank.",
   "note": "badge NGÂN HÀNG TRUNG ƯƠNG slid across table"
  },
  {
   "id": "D7",
   "size": "close-up",
   "key": 30,
   "len": 73,
   "first": 5419,
   "line": "He says just one thing: please,",
   "note": "suit tired close-up"
  },
  {
   "id": "D8",
   "size": "insert",
   "key": 30,
   "len": 40,
   "first": 5492,
   "line": "stop tapping.",
   "note": "Pip's hand frozen above terminal"
  },
  {
   "id": "D9",
   "size": "close-up",
   "key": 30,
   "len": 69,
   "first": 5532,
   "line": "That's when you finally understand.",
   "note": "Pip understands"
  },
  {
   "id": "D10",
   "size": "macro",
   "key": 45,
   "len": 28,
   "first": 5601,
   "line": "Money has no value",
   "note": "banknote fades to paper"
  },
  {
   "id": "D11",
   "size": "schematic",
   "key": 90,
   "len": 143,
   "first": 5629,
   "line": "by itself. Money is just a promise that someone will trade you their work.",
   "note": "note <-> person, LỜI HỨA"
  },
  {
   "id": "D12",
   "size": "medium",
   "key": 30,
   "len": 52,
   "first": 5772,
   "line": "The rice a farmer grows.",
   "note": "farmer plants rice at dawn"
  },
  {
   "id": "D13",
   "size": "medium",
   "key": 30,
   "len": 48,
   "first": 5824,
   "line": "A surgeon's operation.",
   "note": "surgeon under lamp"
  },
  {
   "id": "D14",
   "size": "medium",
   "key": 40,
   "len": 93,
   "first": 5872,
   "line": "The bread a baker gets up at four in the morning to bake.",
   "note": "baker at clay oven 04:00"
  },
  {
   "id": "D15",
   "size": "card",
   "key": 50,
   "len": 70,
   "first": 5965,
   "line": "Infinite money can't make more rice.",
   "note": "rice bowl +0"
  },
  {
   "id": "D16",
   "size": "card",
   "key": 40,
   "len": 60,
   "first": 6035,
   "line": "It can't make more doctors.",
   "note": "doctor +0"
  },
  {
   "id": "D17",
   "size": "card",
   "key": 50,
   "len": 93,
   "first": 6095,
   "line": "It can't add a single hour to the day.",
   "note": "clock 24 GIỜ +0"
  },
  {
   "id": "D18",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 40,
   "len": 98,
   "first": 6188,
   "line": "The next morning, your mom still gets up early and pushes her",
   "note": "mum and xôi cart at alley mouth"
  },
  {
   "id": "D19",
   "size": "medium",
   "key": 30,
   "len": 110,
   "first": 6286,
   "line": "sticky rice cart to the end of the alley, like every day.",
   "note": "mum pushes cart"
  },
  {
   "id": "D20",
   "size": "medium",
   "key": 30,
   "len": 114,
   "first": 6396,
   "line": "You ask: I have infinite money now, why are you still",
   "note": "Pip asks mum"
  },
  {
   "id": "D21",
   "size": "close-up",
   "key": 30,
   "len": 56,
   "first": 6510,
   "line": "selling? She smiles:",
   "note": "mum smiles"
  },
  {
   "id": "D22",
   "size": "insert",
   "key": 36,
   "len": 74,
   "first": 6566,
   "line": "because people still need breakfast, sweetheart.",
   "note": "neighbour takes xôi packet"
  },
  {
   "id": "E1",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 30,
   "len": 82,
   "first": 6640,
   "line": "That day, you help her sell for one morning.",
   "note": "dawn alley wide: mum + Pip at the xoi cart, customers, steam"
  },
  {
   "id": "E2",
   "size": "medium",
   "key": 24,
   "len": 41,
   "first": 6722,
   "line": "For the first time in your life,",
   "note": "Pip takes a 10.000 note, hands a packet"
  },
  {
   "id": "E3",
   "size": "insert",
   "key": 34,
   "len": 65,
   "first": 6763,
   "line": "you hold money you earned yourself.",
   "note": "insert: notes land in Pip mitten"
  },
  {
   "id": "E4",
   "size": "insert",
   "key": 24,
   "len": 53,
   "first": 6828,
   "line": "Fifteen thousand dong.",
   "note": "insert: 15.000 d tag"
  },
  {
   "id": "E5",
   "size": "medium",
   "key": 46,
   "len": 60,
   "first": 6881,
   "line": "It feels heavier than the black card.",
   "note": "scale: notes outweigh the black card"
  },
  {
   "id": "E6",
   "size": "medium",
   "key": 40,
   "len": 128,
   "first": 6941,
   "line": "So if you had infinite money, what's the smartest way to spend it?",
   "note": "Pip thinking at desk, ? bubble"
  },
  {
   "id": "E7",
   "size": "medium",
   "key": 44,
   "len": 50,
   "first": 7069,
   "line": "Not on more stuff.",
   "note": "pile of stuff crossed out"
  },
  {
   "id": "E8",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 66,
   "len": 76,
   "first": 7119,
   "line": "On helping the world make more things.",
   "note": "schematic: money -> factory+school -> goods"
  },
  {
   "id": "E9",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 50,
   "len": 47,
   "first": 7195,
   "line": "Build schools to train more doctors.",
   "note": "medical school rising, crane"
  },
  {
   "id": "E10",
   "size": "medium",
   "key": 50,
   "len": 82,
   "first": 7242,
   "line": "Fund research on better rice.",
   "note": "scientists, taller rice"
  },
  {
   "id": "E11",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 30,
   "len": 60,
   "first": 7324,
   "line": "Send poor kids to school.",
   "note": "kids with backpacks walk to school"
  },
  {
   "id": "E12",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 50,
   "len": 111,
   "first": 7384,
   "line": "You pay teachers and doctors in remote villages really well.",
   "note": "mountain teacher then village doctor, pan"
  },
  {
   "id": "E13",
   "size": "medium",
   "key": 40,
   "len": 39,
   "first": 7495,
   "line": "You fund scientists,",
   "note": "scientist with glowing flask"
  },
  {
   "id": "E14",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 66,
   "len": 87,
   "first": 7534,
   "line": "so they can find cheaper power and cleaner water.",
   "note": "solar panel + water drop"
  },
  {
   "id": "E15",
   "size": "insert",
   "key": 30,
   "len": 48,
   "first": 7621,
   "line": "You tap slower.",
   "note": "card taps terminal slowly, green tick"
  },
  {
   "id": "E16",
   "size": "medium",
   "key": 40,
   "len": 80,
   "first": 7669,
   "line": "Less often. But every time you tap,",
   "note": "tap, a school pops up"
  },
  {
   "id": "E17",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 50,
   "len": 89,
   "first": 7749,
   "line": "the world gets one more real thing.",
   "note": "taps: well + clinic pop up"
  },
  {
   "id": "E18",
   "size": "insert",
   "key": 50,
   "len": 92,
   "first": 7838,
   "line": "A year later, the black card is still in your wallet.",
   "note": "wallet with the card, MOT NAM SAU"
  },
  {
   "id": "E19",
   "size": "close",
   "key": 40,
   "len": 66,
   "first": 7930,
   "line": "You use it less than you ever imagined.",
   "note": "Pip at desk, card unused, mug"
  },
  {
   "id": "E20",
   "size": "medium",
   "key": 40,
   "len": 100,
   "first": 7996,
   "line": "And your mom still sells sticky rice at the end of the alley.",
   "note": "mum scooping xoi"
  },
  {
   "id": "E21",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 40,
   "len": 87,
   "first": 8096,
   "line": "It's still the best in town.",
   "note": "Pip eating xoi on a stool, mum at cart"
  },
  {
   "id": "E22",
   "size": "medium",
   "key": 70,
   "len": 147,
   "first": 8183,
   "line": "One day, your best friend asks: if you could choose again, would you still want that",
   "note": "Mo asks, Pip holds card"
  },
  {
   "id": "E23",
   "size": "close",
   "key": 40,
   "len": 88,
   "first": 8330,
   "line": "card? You think for a long time. Then you say:",
   "note": "Pip thinks, close-up"
  },
  {
   "id": "E24",
   "size": "medium",
   "key": 60,
   "len": 123,
   "first": 8418,
   "line": "yes. But now I know what to use it for.",
   "note": "Pip smiles, card up to sunset"
  },
  {
   "id": "E25",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 60,
   "len": 128,
   "first": 8541,
   "line": "So, if you had a card with no limit, what's the first thing you'd buy?",
   "note": "end card line 1"
  },
  {
   "id": "E26",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 120,
   "len": 202,
   "first": 8669,
   "line": "And would you dare to use it to change the world? Tell us in the comments.",
   "note": "end card line 2, fade out"
  }
 ],
